type: software
title: "Astro Code OJ (AC OJ)"
abstract: >-
  Astro Code OJ is an online judge platform for programming education and
  algorithm training. Java / Spring Boot provides business and admin APIs;
  Go (go-zero) handles judging and code similarity; Vue 3 provides the admin
  and user frontends.
